# WebOnOne v2 project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/webonone-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/webonone-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`webonone-v2/frontend`, `webonone-v2/backend`, `webonone-v2/backend/migrations`.

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3000 | `webonone-v2/frontend/.env` |
| Backend | 4000 | `webonone-v2/backend/.env` |

`JWT_SECRET` must match Identity backend. Super-admin seed: `SUPER_ADMIN_USER_ID` (Identity `user_id`), `SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL`, `SUPER_ADMIN_DISPLAY_NAME`.

## Database

MySQL schema **`webonone_v2`** — themes, user preferences, site media refs, **companies**, and **`users_roles`** (platform/company permissions linked to Identity `user_id`). Migrations run via `npm run migrate -w @webonone/webonone-backend`. Seed super admin via `npm run seed -w @webonone/webonone-backend` (requires `SUPER_ADMIN_USER_ID`).

## Ownership

- `/login` redirects to Identity — **no local login forms**.
- `/callback` exchanges auth code for JWT via Identity API (standalone OAuth only).
- **All peer redirection** uses the same pattern — see [platform-shell-navigation.mdc](platform-shell-navigation.mdc):
  - **Profile:** `handleProfileClick` + `redirectToIdentityProfile.ts`
  - **Email:** `handleEmailClick` + nav `onClick` on `PLATFORM_EMAIL_NAV` + `redirectToEmail.ts`
  - No `/go/*` routes, no intermediate redirect pages.
- JWT **verification** locally; no per-request Identity HTTP on hot paths.
- Basic Settings (`/settings/basic`) — company registration wizard and company section.
- Company API is **native** to WebOnOne BE (`/api/v1/company/*`) — not a separate microservice.

Key paths: `features/settings/basic/`, `backend/src/routes/company.routes.ts`, `backend/src/services/company.service.ts`, `backend/src/middleware/auth.ts`, `backend/src/middleware/requireSuperAdmin.ts`.

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root
```

Login flow requires Identity running (`npm run dev:identity`).

All interactive UI must use `@webonone/ui-kit` — see [ui-kit-consumption.mdc](ui-kit-consumption.mdc). Do not duplicate UI Kit primitives.

